# One sentence, present tense, describing what the change does.
# Ends with a full stop. No body unless a reader genuinely needs one.
#
# Good:
#   Cache restaurant searches so a warm process survives a short Overpass outage.
#   Split hard constraints from soft preferences so the two cannot be conflated.
#
# Avoid:
#   Bullet lists, emoji, generated trailers, and messages that only restate the diff.
